'Constant speed direct field with Thorp volume attenuation'  ! TITLE
@FREQUENCY_HZ@          ! FREQ (Hz)
1                       ! NMEDIA
'CVWT'                  ! C-linear SSP, vacuum surface, Thorp attenuation
2  0.0  1000.0          ! SSP points, sigma, bottom depth (m)
0.0     1500.0  0.0  1.0  0.0 /
1000.0  1500.0  0.0  1.0  0.0 /
'A' 0.0                 ! Matched acoustic half-space; rays do not reach it
1000.0  1500.0  0.0  1.0  0.0 /
1                       ! NSD
500.0 /                 ! Source depth (m)
11                      ! NRD
480.0  520.0 /          ! Receiver depths (m)
101                     ! NR
1.0  10.0 /             ! Receiver ranges (km)
'CC'                    ! Coherent TL, Cartesian Cerveny beams
@NALPHA@                ! Shared launch-angle count derived from fmax
-2.0  2.0 /             ! Launch angles (degrees)
10.0  1100.0  10.1      ! Step (m), ZBOX (m), RBOX (km)
'MS' 1.0  5.0           ! Standard curvature, epsilon multiplier, Rloop (km)
3  5  'P'               ! Images, beam window, pressure component
